          <text class="latin-hint" wx:if="{{tempProduct.isOneOfAKind}}">开启后：售罄可「想要」候补与「付定金」锁优先；标本师上架后定金用户需在规则时限内付尾款，逾期开放且定金不退。</text>
          <view class="form-row"><text>列入标本档案</text><switch checked="{{tempProduct.inArchive}}" color="#C4A76C" bindchange="bindPInArchive" style="transform:scale(0.7)"/></view>
          <view class="form-row"><text>参与会员折扣</text><switch checked="{{tempProduct.memberDiscountEnabled !== false}}" color="#C4A76C" bindchange="bindPMemberDiscount" style="transform:scale(0.7)"/></view>
